        "id": "572752",
        "title": "Total Trainees",
        "difficulty": "easy",
        "description": "<p>The Online Course Platform teamed up with the Neighborhood Language School to offer students both technical training and language immersion. To recognize the most dedicated learners, coordinators need a report showing who has truly committed time across both programs and meets the minimum combined-hours requirement.</p>\n<p>You are given two tables: &lsquo;online_courses&rsquo; and &lsquo;language_classes&rsquo;.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The &lsquo;online_courses&rsquo; table contains &lsquo;session_id&rsquo;, &lsquo;student_name&rsquo;, and &lsquo;hours_spent&rsquo;. Each row logs how many hours a student spent on a single online module.</li>\n<li>The &lsquo;language_classes&rsquo; table contains &lsquo;class_id&rsquo;, &lsquo;student_name&rsquo;, and &lsquo;duration&rsquo;. Each row logs how many hours a student spent in one language lesson.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Your task is to</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"493\">Identify students who have both online course sessions and language class attendance.</li>\n<li data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"529\">For each such student, calculate:\n<ul>\n<li>total_online_hours: the sum of hours_spent across all their online sessions,</li>\n<li>total_language_hours: the sum of duration across all their language classes,</li>\n<li>combined_hours as the sum of those two totals.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"817\">Only include students whose combined_hours is at least 20.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The output columns should be &lsquo;student_name&rsquo;, &lsquo;total_online_hours&rsquo;, &lsquo;total_language_hours&rsquo;, and &lsquo;combined_hours&rsquo;, ordered by &lsquo;combined_hours&rsquo; descending, then by &lsquo;student_name&rsquo; ascending.</p>",
        "schema": "CREATE TABLE online_courses (\n  session_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  student_name VARCHAR(100),\n  hours_spent DECIMAL(5,2)\n);\nCREATE TABLE language_classes (\n  class_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  student_name VARCHAR(100),\n  duration DECIMAL(5,2)\n);\nINSERT INTO online_courses VALUES\n  (101, 'Eve Blue',    8.00),\n  (102, 'Eve Blue',    7.50),\n  (103, 'Frank Gray',  4.00),\n  (104, 'Gina White',  10.00),\n  (105, 'Frank Gray',  6.00);\nINSERT INTO language_classes VALUES\n  (101, 'Eve Blue',     5.00),\n  (102, 'Frank Gray',   8.00),\n  (103, 'Gina White',   3.50),\n  (104, 'Hank Black',   12.00);\n\n",
        "slug": "total-trainees",
